---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';

// Integrated Management System base domain
const IMS_DOMAIN = 'https://docs.impactorbit.co/ims/';
---

<Layout title="Legal, Governance & Policies">

  <main class="py-8">
    <Hero 
      title="Legal, Governance & Policies" 
      description="This page outlines Impact Orbit Creative Group’s legal framework, governance approach, and integrated management system, including links to our core policies and standards."
    />

    <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-secondary-500">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-4xl mx-auto">

          <p class="mb-8 text-white dark:text-white">
            <strong>Last Updated:</strong> 30 July 2025
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">1. Legal Entity and Scope</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            <strong>Impact Orbit Creative Group Ltd</strong> (“Impact Orbit”, “we”, “our”, or “us”) is a private limited company registered in England and Wales (Company No. 15207389).
          </p>

          <address class="not-italic mb-8">
            DOCK – Space City<br />
            75 Exploration Drive<br />
            Leicester, LE4 5NU<br />
            United Kingdom
          </address>

          <p class="mb-8">
            This framework applies to Impact Orbit Creative Group Ltd and its associated brands, initiatives, and platforms, including
            <strong> Green Orbit Space Communications & PR</strong>, unless otherwise stated.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">2. Governance and Accountability</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Impact Orbit operates a governance model designed to support transparency, accountability, and responsible decision-making across commercial, environmental, and social domains.
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Defined executive accountability for legal, ethical, and sustainability matters.</li>
            <li>Documented policies aligned with UK law and recognised international standards.</li>
            <li>Risk-based decision-making informed by materiality and proportionality.</li>
            <li>Scheduled policy review as part of continual improvement.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">3. Integrated Management System (IMS)</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Impact Orbit maintains an <a href={`${IMS_DOMAIN}`} <strong>Integrated Management System (IMS)</strong></a> that consolidates governance, risk management,
            information security, sustainability, quality, and business continuity into a single operating framework.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-6">
            The IMS is aligned with the intent and principles of the following standards:
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>
              <a href={`${IMS_DOMAIN}/standards/iso-9001`} class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                ISO 9001 – Quality Management
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href={`${IMS_DOMAIN}/standards/iso-27001`} class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                ISO/IEC 27001 – Information Security Management
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href={`${IMS_DOMAIN}/standards/iso-14001`} class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                ISO 14001 – Environmental Management
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href={`${IMS_DOMAIN}/standards/iso-22301`} class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                ISO 22301 – Business Continuity
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-8">
            Certification status may vary by standard; however, all policies, controls, and procedures are designed to support
            auditability, regulatory compliance, and continual improvement.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">4. Core Public Policies</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            The following policies are publicly available and apply across Impact Orbit’s websites, services, and client engagements.
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-10 list-disc list-inside space-y-3">
            <li>
              <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/information-security-policy" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">Information Security Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/data-protection-policy" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">Data Protection Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/sustainability-policy" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                Sustainability & Environmental Policy
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/code-of-conduct" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                Code of Conduct & Ethics
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">5. Risk Management</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Risks are identified, assessed, and managed through the IMS using a proportionate, risk-based approach.
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Information security and data protection risks.</li>
            <li>Operational and delivery risks.</li>
            <li>Legal and regulatory compliance risks.</li>
            <li>Environmental and sustainability risks.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">6. Third Parties and Suppliers</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Suppliers and partners are selected and managed in line with IMS controls, including contractual requirements for
            confidentiality, data protection, and security where applicable.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">7. Policy Review and Updates</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            This page and the associated policies are reviewed periodically. The current, authoritative versions of IMS-controlled
            documents are maintained within the IMS domain.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">8. Contact and Further Information</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            For enquiries regarding governance, policies, or the Integrated Management System:
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-6">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
          </div>

          <address class="not-italic text-sm mb-8">
            Impact Orbit Creative Group Ltd<br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:hello@impactorbit.co" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">hello@impactorbit.co</a><br />
            Phone: +44 116 483 0155
          </address>

        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

</Layout>